    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BallStack is a vibrant match-3  game that challenges you to stack and match colorful balls\u2014red, blue, purple, green, white and yellow\u2014to clear levels and climb the leaderboard! With intuitive tap-to-match mechanics, you\u2019ll strategize to create combos, earn power-ups, and tackle increasingly tricky puzzles. Perfect for casual gamers and puzzle enthusiasts alike, BallStack offers:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Colorful Gameplay: Match red, blue, purple, green, white and yellow balls to clear the board.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Power-Ups &amp; Boosters: Unlock special abilities to blast through tough spots.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leaderboards: Compete with friends and players worldwide to become the ultimate BallStack champion.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relaxing Fun: Enjoy a bright, cheerful art style and satisfying gameplay that\u2019s easy to pick up, hard to master.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into BallStack today and start stacking your way to victory!</p>",
